%N A400440 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = (1 + x*A(x^4))^2.
%H A400440 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A400440/b400440.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%F A400440 a(0) = 1; a(4*n+1) = 2*a(n), a(4*n+2) = Sum_{k=0..n} a(k)*a(n-k), and a(4*n+3) = a(4*n+4) = 0 for n >= 0.
%F A400440 a(0) = 1; a(n) = (1/n) * Sum_{k=0..floor((n-1)/4)} (-n+12*k+3)*a(k)*a(n-1-4*k).
